//! The `row-rule-style` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines the
//! line style of the lines drawn between rows in multi-row grid, flex, and multi-col layouts.
//!
//! Grammar: <line-style-list> | <auto-line-style-list>
//!
